# Email Notification & Meeting Request Flow

This sequence diagram shows how admins can send meeting invites or notifications to users.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant ADMIN as Admin
    participant C as Dashboard Client
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant SVC as Support Microservice
    participant EMAIL as Email Service (SES/SMTP)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant USER as User

    ADMIN->>C: Send Meeting Request (User, Subject, Link)
    C->>API: POST /support/email/send
    API->>SVC: Forward Request
    SVC->>EMAIL: Send Email via SES
    EMAIL-->>SVC: Response (SENT)
    SVC->>DB: Insert EmailLog(status=SENT)
    DB-->>SVC: OK
    SVC-->>API: Response 200 OK
    API-->>C: Display “Email Sent”
    EMAIL-->>USER: User Receives Meeting Invite
